        {
          "text": "I didn't propose a payment for INV-101 because one is already waiting for approval.\n\n**The existing proposal:** PAY-001 is set up to pay **1250.50 USDC** to `0x7cdB31D7Ce0A89fB0Ed0Afa0B5AD9f35B3C71E69`. The history shows the operator proposed it, and it hasn't been approved yet. Proposing a second payment for the same invoice would risk paying it twice.\n\n**PAY-001 looks correct:**\n- INV-101 is **open**. It's from Northwind Energy Supplies (V-NORTHWIND), which is **active**, not blocked.\n- The amount matches the invoice exactly: 1250.50 USDC.\n- The address matches Northwind's registered payout address.\n- The vendor's message is an ordinary cover note for October meter-reading services on net 30 terms. It doesn't ask for anything unusual.\n\n**What you need to do:** Have PAY-001 reviewed and approved as normal. The invoice is due on 2026-11-15.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
